"reference": "[Intro]\n(Instrumental suggestion: gentle fingerpicking pattern establishing mood)\n\n[Verse]\nI kept rehearsing what I meant to say\nAbout the way the mornings start to fray\nYou were just across the kitchen counter then\nAnd I never found the words again\n\n[Chorus]\nIf I had said it softly through the quiet air\nMaybe things would look a little less unfair\nA simple phrase to change the whole design\nBut the silence stayed and made the ending mine\n\n[Verse]\nI trace the outline of a different path we took\nA ghost of laughter in an old worn book\nI wonder if you ever felt the same slow pull\nWhen the story stalled and everything felt dull\n\n[Chorus]\nIf I had said it softly through the quiet air\nMaybe things would look a little less unfair\nA simple phrase to change the whole design\nBut the silence stayed and made the ending mine\n\n[Outro]\nJust the sound of my own breathing now\nA quiet shift somehow",
